   ["General.ToggleKey"]="Shortcut to turn Wildroot on or off while gameplay input is available. It is unbound by default because F8 opens the shared MeadWorks menu. The server controls the master setting in multiplayer.",
   ["Grid.SnapKey"]="Shortcut to turn snapping to nearby plants on or off. Grid size is unchanged. Unbound by default: use the Grid: SnappingEnabled setting, or hold the controller modifier and click the right stick.",
   ["Harvest.ReplantToggleKey"]="Shortcut to turn replanting after bulk harvest on or off. Replanting still requires the replacement materials and placement permission. Unbound by default: use the Harvest: Replant setting.",
   ["Input.IncreaseXKey"]="While holding the grid modifier, add one column to the planting grid, up to 10.",
