   ["Input.KeyboardHarvestModifierKey"]="Hold this keyboard shortcut while using a ripe resource to harvest nearby resources within Harvest Radius.",
   ["Planting.PreventPartialPlanting"]="On: refuse the entire grid if any cell cannot be planted. Off: plant the cells allowed by Prevent Invalid Planting. Placement permissions still apply to every cell.",
   ["Planting.PreventInvalidPlanting"]="On: skip extra grid cells that fail growth or placement checks. Off: allow extra cells with biological or target failures; the root cell must still be valid and permission failures are never bypassed.",
   ["Planting.UseStamina"]="On: planting with the cultivator uses the native stamina cost. Off: cultivator placement costs no stamina.",
   ["Planting.UseDurability"]="On: cultivator placement uses its native durability cost. Off: planting does not reduce cultivator durability.",
   ["General.Enabled"]="On: enable Wildroot gardening when session permissions allow it. Off: cancel pending gardening work and release Wildroot changes. In multiplayer, the server owns this switch; installed source-mod step-aside still applies.",
   ["Grid.SnappingEnabled"]="On: align the planting grid with nearby plants or pickable resources. Off: place the grid at the unsnapped ghost position.",
   ["Grid.Rows"]="Number of rows in the planting grid, from 1 to 10. With grid planting off, the layout is 1 by 1; Farming row perks can still affect eligible single-crop planting.",
   ["Grid.Columns"]="Number of columns in the planting grid, from 1 to 10. The concurrent placement limit also caps the number of cells.",
   ["Planting.RandomizeRotation"]="On: choose a random heading in 22.5-degree steps for each placement. Off: keep the placement ghost heading. This is independent of position and tilt scatter.",
   ["Planting.EnableScatter"]="On: apply configured position and tilt scatter to new placements. Off: keep grid positions without scatter. Randomize Rotation is a separate switch.",
